WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.065 --> 00:00:03.834
"Rapunzel, no!" Papa shouted.

2
00:00:03.835 --> 00:00:08.181
He looked frightened. "Run away!"

3
00:00:08.182 --> 00:00:10.577
Mama glared at the witch.

4
00:00:10.578 --> 00:00:13.819
"Leave my daughter alone!"

5
00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.372
"It's okay," Rapunzel said bravely.

6
00:00:17.373 --> 00:00:20.827
"I do not want you to turn into hedgehogs.

7
00:00:20.828 --> 00:00:23.205
I will go with the witch.

8
00:00:23.206 --> 00:00:27.977
I will visit you often."

9
00:00:27.978 --> 00:00:33.644
"At least you are wise, girl," the witch said.

10
00:00:33.645 --> 00:00:36.080
Her face turned dark.

11
00:00:36.081 --> 00:00:39.683
"But you can never visit your parents.

12
00:00:39.684 --> 00:00:43.675
They would only hide you from me again."

13
00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:46.633
Rapunzel folded her arms.

14
00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:49.467
"I will work hard for you, Witch.

15
00:00:49.468 --> 00:00:52.889
But I must visit my family!"

16
00:00:52.890 --> 00:00:55.890
The witch shook her finger at Rapunzel.

17
00:00:55.891 --> 00:01:00.622
"I said you can never visit your parents.

18
00:01:00.623 --> 00:01:04.903
If you do, I will turn them into hedgehogs!

19
00:01:04.904 --> 00:01:07.876
Do you understand?"

20
00:01:07.877 --> 00:01:12.062
Tears filled Rapunzel's eyes.

21
00:01:12.063 --> 00:01:15.627
"I must be brave," she thought.

22
00:01:15.628 --> 00:01:19.010
She quickly wiped her tears away.

23
00:01:19.011 --> 00:01:21.869
"Yes. I understand."

24
00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:24.588
"Good!" the witch snapped.

25
00:01:24.589 --> 00:01:27.522
"Now come with me.

26
00:01:27.523 --> 00:01:30.648
It's a long trip to the city.

27
00:01:30.649 --> 00:01:37.139
And I am already tired."

28
00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:40.654
Rapunzel turned to her parents.

29
00:01:40.655 --> 00:01:44.012
Tears rolled down Mama's face.

30
00:01:44.013 --> 00:01:48.891
"We will think of you every day," Mama said.

31
00:01:48.892 --> 00:01:55.241
"We will miss you so much!" Papa said.

32
00:01:55.242 --> 00:01:58.289
Rapunzel reached out to hug them.

33
00:01:58.290 --> 00:02:01.157
But the witch yanked her arm.

34
00:02:01.158 --> 00:02:07.463
"Come along!" she said harshly. "Now!"

35
00:02:07.464 --> 00:02:14.534
The witch dragged Rapunzel away.

36
00:02:14.535 --> 00:02:22.565
Rapunzel looked back at her parents.

37
00:02:22.566 --> 00:02:26.269
"I will never forget them," she thought.

38
00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:30.217
"I will find a way to return home!"

39
00:02:30.218 --> 00:02:34.936
"Oops!" Suddenly Rapunzel tripped over something.

40
00:02:34.937 --> 00:02:38.286
It was the hedgehog.

41
00:02:38.287 --> 00:02:44.212
Rapunzel scooped it up.

42
00:02:44.213 --> 00:02:48.350
She dropped it into her pocket.

43
00:02:48.351 --> 00:02:54.453
The witch spun around. "What are you doing?"

44
00:02:54.454 --> 00:02:58.523
"Um, nothing!" Rapunzel said quickly.

45
00:02:58.524 --> 00:03:03.909
She hurried after the witch.

46
00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:08.335
In Rapunzel's pocket the hedgehog wiggled.

47
00:03:08.336 --> 00:03:11.981
Rapunzel patted it.

48
00:03:11.982 --> 00:03:15.371
"You need a friend," she whispered.

49
00:03:15.372 --> 00:03:20.082
"And so do I!"

